  "query_preview": "/Monday through Friday/...\nGradual cooling now expected to continue through the coming \nweek whereas yesterday's forecast held temperatures level after\nMonday. The persistent upper ridge over the Great Basin is \nforecast to slowly weaken and retreat southward as cooler \nwesterly flow comes in across the northern intermountain region.\nA low-amplitude trough will develop Wednesday, with the \nwesterly flow changing to southwesterly and again bringing \nmonsoon moisture northward, leading to a slight chance of \nafternoon thunderstorms near the NV/ID border Wednesday and \nThursday.",
